<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan's Ta Chen limit up on debut.</title>
<headline>Taiwan's Ta Chen limit up on debut.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ta Chen Stainless Pipe Co Ltd had a dazzling debut on the Taiwan Stock Exchange on Thursday, rising the the daily seven percent limit in late-morning trade.</p>
<p>One hour before the close, Ta Chen was was limit-up at T$26.7.</p>
<p>Ta Chen was likely to continue rising on a traditional &quot;celebration rally,&quot; brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;This kind of downstream company is stable in their operations, though they may not be outstanding,&quot; said Oliver Fang of National Securities.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
